(7717935, 1269196, 75585, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by kasaba:</b></div><hr/><i> Congratulations! Is that something they "do" with this pup, or did you dream it up? </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>I photograph families and have done this pose with baby/toddlers so I thought itd be cute with this darling little puppy.  Had to improvise because the puppy is so teeny - thank goodness they had some steps to put her on otherwise it would have looked super awkward bent over too far BUT then the sun in the sky was a problem on day one, thankfully they were open to reshooting a second time.</td>', 'Originally posted by kasaba: Congratulations! Is that something they "do" with this pup, or did you dream it up?   I photograph families and have done this pose with baby/toddlers so I thought itd be cute with this darling little puppy.  Had to improvise because the puppy is so teeny - thank goodness they had some steps to put her on otherwise it would have looked super awkward bent over too far BUT then the sun in the sky was a problem on day one, thankfully they were open to reshooting a second time.', '2022-04-01 01:19:30.000000', NULL, 0),
